{"strongs": "H8544", "word": "תְּמוּנָה", "translit": "te.mu.nah", "root": "מין", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "likeness, form", "definition": "תְּמוּנָה noun feminine likeness, form ; — ׳ ת Exod 20:4 + 4 t.; construct תְּמוּנַת ( תְּמֻנַת ) Deut 4:16 + 3 t.; suffix תְּמוּנָתֶ֑ךָ Ps 17:15 — likeness, representation (|| פֶּסֶל ) Exod 20:4 = Deut 5:8 , compare Deut 4:16 ; Deut 4:23 ; Deut 4:25 form, semblance of ׳ י Num 12:8 ; Ps 17:15 , compare Deut 4:12 (see Dr ), v Deut 4:15 of nocturnal apparition Job 4:16 . מֵינֶ֫קֶת see ינק Hiph`il מיסך see [ מוּסָךְ ] below סכך . מֵיפַ֫עַת , מֵפָ֑עַת , מופעת see יפע .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4630')\">BDB4630</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8544')\">H8544</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4629')\">BDB4629</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4631')\">BDB4631</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תְּמוּנָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>likeness, form</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,4)\">Exod 20:4</ref> + 4 t.; construct <bdbheb>תְּמוּנַת</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>תְּמֻנַת</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Deut 4:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,16)\">Deut 4:16</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>תְּמוּנָתֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 17:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,15)\">Ps 17:15</ref> — <highlight>likeness, representation</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>פֶּסֶל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Exod 20:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,4)\">Exod 20:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"Deut 5:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,8)\">Deut 5:8</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 4:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,16)\">Deut 4:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,23)\">Deut 4:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,25)\">Deut 4:25</ref> <highlight>form, semblance</highlight> of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 12:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,8)\">Num 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 17:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,17,15)\">Ps 17:15</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 4:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,12)\">Deut 4:12</ref> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>), v<ref ref=\"Deut 4:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,15)\">Deut 4:15</ref> of nocturnal apparition <ref ref=\"Job 4:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,16)\">Job 4:16</ref>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מֵינֶ֫קֶת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>ינק</reflink></bdbheb> <b>Hiph`il</b> </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מיסך</bdbheb> see [ <bdbheb><reflink>מוּסָךְ</reflink></bdbheb>] below <bdbheb>סכך</bdbheb>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>מֵיפַ֫עַת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מֵפָ֑עַת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מופעת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>יפע</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 20:4", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 20, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Deut 4:16", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ps 17:15", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 17, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Deut 5:8", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 5, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 4:23", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Deut 4:25", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Num 12:8", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 12, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 4:12", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Deut 4:15", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Job 4:16", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 4,